## 🔗 **INTEGRATION REQUIREMENTS**

### Cross-Standard Integration
- **Timeline → Coordination:** Link timeline entries to coordination activities
- **Navigation → All:** Support navigation for all documentation types
- **Quality → All:** Quality metrics apply to all documentation
- **Research → Planning:** Research informs planning decisions
- **Audit → Quality:** Audits validate quality standards

### MCP Tool Integration
- **Use `mcp_lucid-mcp_add_timeline_entry`** for timeline tracking
- **Use `mcp_lucid-mcp_get_timeline_summary`** for timeline queries
- **Use `mcp_lucid-mcp_store_memory`** for coordination context
- **Use `mcp_lucid-mcp_retrieve_memory`** for context retrieval

---

## ✅ **QUALITY REQUIREMENTS**

### Supporting Documentation Quality Standards
- **Completeness** - All required sections present
- **Consistency** - Follow established formats
- **Clarity** - Clear and understandable
- **Current** - Keep documentation updated
- **Cross-referenced** - Link related documentation

### Regular Updates
- **Timeline:** Update after milestones
- **Coordination:** Update during coordination activities
- **Status Reports:** Weekly/monthly updates
- **Navigation:** Update when new concepts added
- **Quality:** Regular measurement and tracking

---

## 🚨 **CRITICAL RULES**

### Never Skip These
- ❌ **Never skip timeline tracking** - Preserve history
- ❌ **Never skip coordination documentation** - Enable team coordination
- ❌ **Never skip navigation updates** - Maintain findability
- ❌ **Never skip quality tracking** - Monitor quality continuously
- ❌ **Never skip research documentation** - Preserve knowledge

### Always Do These
- ✅ **Always update timeline** - Track significant events
- ✅ **Always document coordination** - Enable team work
- ✅ **Always maintain navigation** - Keep findability high
- ✅ **Always track quality** - Monitor continuously
- ✅ **Always document research** - Preserve knowledge

